程，让你快速掌握竞赛考点。</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"second\">\n        <span class=\"line\">2、一些难的知识点和不知道如何规划学习进度的时候</span>\n        <span class=\"line\">，最好选择报课，大部分学生在有人一起学的情况下</span>\n        <span class=\"line\">会比较好。</span>\n        <span class=\"line\">有时候你以为自己自学学的挺好，但是很多竞赛技巧</span>\n        <span class=\"line\">、思维是需要老师来指导的。时间和钱，不能兼得。</span>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"visuals\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder radial-placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Diagram: bottom-left circular segmented diagram]</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 188 168\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <defs>\n            <pattern id=\"hatchA\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(18)\">\n              <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"4\" stroke=\"#9c7035\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            </pattern>\n            <pattern id=\"hatchB\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(-18)\">\n              <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"4\" stroke=\"#aa7b3a\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            </pattern>\n          </defs>\n\n          <g transform=\"translate(84 82)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a57b40\" stroke-width=\"1.1\">\n            <circle r=\"68\" stroke=\"#c4a373\"/>\n            <circle r=\"43\" stroke=\"#c4a373\"/>\n            <circle r=\"22\" stroke=\"#c4a373\"/>\n            <circle r=\"13\" fill=\"url(#hatchA)\" stroke=\"#8f642e\"/>\n\n            <path d=\"M0,-68 A68,68 0 0 1 35,-58 L22,-36 A43,43 0 0 0 0,-43 Z\" fill=\"url(#hatchA)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M43,0 A43,43 0 0 1 21,37 L11,19 A22,22 0 0 0 22,0 Z\" fill=\"url(#hatchB)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M20,38 A43,43 0 0 1 -15,40 L-8,21 A22,22 0 0 0 11,19 Z\" fill=\"url(#hatchA)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M-42,8 A43,43 0 0 1 -37,-22 L-19,-11 A22,22 0 0 0 -21,4 Z\" fill=\"url(#hatchB)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M-37,-56 A68,68 0 0 1 -1,-68 L0,-43 A43,43 0 0 0 -23,-36 Z\" fill=\"url(